# Act One

EXT. FERRY TERMINAL - NIGHT #1#

Rain taps the roof. MAYA lays a **brass key** beside the _old radio_. A sign reads: *Last crossing at dusk.*

MAYA
(quietly)
I thought you said the river was safe. Every light on the far bank is still burning.

ELIAS
I said the bridge was safe.

MAYA
Then we take the bridge.

ELIAS ^
There is no bridge.

